[style name="dialogue_style"]
A sturdy safe stands in the corner of the room.
if {has_seen_safe} == false:
	set {has_seen_safe} = true
	Safe added to journal.
	[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"add_evidence":"safe"}"]
if {has_key} == true:
	- Use Golden Key
		Inside the safe is a huge amount of priceless valuables.
		Above all of it, though, is a sheet of paper.
		Dracula's will added to journal.
		[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"add_evidence":"fake_will"}"]
		join niece left
		niece: Oh, what's that? You've found the old man's will?
		niece: And the principal beneficiary is... none other than, yours truly?
		niece: I expected nothing less.
	- Leave
